cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this port, please cite it together with the upstream project it derives from."
title: "dsh-web-access: DeepSeek Harness port of web-access"
abstract: >-
  A native DeepSeek Harness (dsh) plugin plus skill that ports eze-is/web-access (MIT):
  an in-process Chrome DevTools Protocol client exposed as 17 native web_* tools, together
  with the channel-selection strategy layer (web_search / web_fetch / browser CDP),
  per-domain experience accumulation, and subagent divide-and-conquer guidance.
  This is a derivative work, not an upstream release, and is not endorsed by upstream.
